    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DERELICT PROPERTY AND OUTBUILDINGS ON CIRCA 0.9 ACRES\r\n\r\nThe property is located just off the R639 after Kilcoran Lodge hotel coming from Cahir at the end of the L7307 cul de sac road on the left-hand side. It has scenic views of the Knockmealdown & galty mountains &may qualify for the derelict homes grant. Ideally located just 5 mins drive to junction 11 of the M8 motorway, Cahir 10 mins and Mitchelstown 15 mins."
      },
